{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420099-chart-of-yozi-soul-hierarchies","id":1420099,"title":"Chart of Yozi soul hierarchies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-25T03:04:30-07:00","id":1420099,"title":"Chart of Yozi soul hierarchies","content":"<b>So what is this?</b><br /> <br /> A chart of the official Yozis and demons, organised by descent. Doesn't cover dead ones, previous incarnations, or First Circles with individual names.<br /> <br /> Sources are for where in each edition their place in the soul hierarchy is originally given (although I've bent that a couple of times); it doesn't cover every mention of a given demon.<br /> <br /> May well be incomplete; let me know if I've missed something.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Gah, lost the formatting. Okay, putting the original document up on Google Drive, with Reighnhell's additions included.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1B03Ihrn3aIW4lZBoWEvV_4jbNa-MjULP/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Yozi soul hierarchy</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 10-25-2020, 12:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T07:55:29-07:00","id":1420124,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Demons</b><br /> <br /> Great Work - I have a similar list in my notes and I am using this to fill in the blanks.<br /> <br /> I have a few that didn't appear here, but some of their mentions were super brief (little more than a name drop). <hr /><br /> <b>1st Circle (Adorjan)</b><br /> Fulope, The Choral Equestrian (100 Devils)<br /> <br /> <b>2nd Circle (Unknown)</b><br /> Ashafethe (Exalted 3rd, pg. 424)<br /> Calondra, Scribe of Tides Forgotten (100 Devils)<br /> Glafira, the Zodiac of Blood (Exalted 3rd, pg. 471)<br /> Guyomard, Attendant of the Dancing Mirror (Compass: Malfeas, pg. 58)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T19:46:23-07:00","id":1420200,"title":"","content":"Huh. I could've sworn the fetich appelation was &quot;shin giri&quot; for some reason, not sure where I got that from. Also shouldn't Ruvelia be part of Malfeas' soul hierarchy, perhaps with a tab indicating she's deceased? Theion from Shards has a sidebar that specifically mentions were he be reduced to Malfeas he would retain the prerequisite charms for having two fetiches despite being too wounded at that point to support both.<br /> <br /> Also, I believe the fetich of Sacheverell's predecessor was called The White Ram; he was mentioned as executed by Lunars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26460-organ-boy","name":"Organ Boy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T02:16:03-07:00","id":1420232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Organ Boy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420099-chart-of-yozi-soul-hierarchies?p=1420200#post1420200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh. I could've sworn the fetich appelation was &quot;shin giri&quot; for some reason, not sure where I got that from. Also shouldn't Ruvelia be part of Malfeas' soul hierarchy, perhaps with a tab indicating she's deceased? Theion from Shards has a sidebar that specifically mentions were he be reduced to Malfeas he would retain the prerequisite charms for having two fetiches despite being too wounded at that point to support both.<br /> <br /> Also, I believe the fetich of Sacheverell's predecessor was called The White Ram; he was mentioned as executed by Lunars.</div> </div> </div> </div>As mentioned, not doing dead Primordials or demons, so no Ruvelia or White Ram.<br /> <br /> Going by the sidebar on p.18 of RoGD II, <i>shin giri</i> is typically Ligier-specific, <i>giri</i> being an adjective normally used solely for Ligier in his relationship to Malfeas. Other fetiches would have their own equivalents using the adjectives their Yozis gave them (<i>shin</i> [X])","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T05:58:30-07:00","id":1420439,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry I don't really understand how it works. The less indented name on the left is supposed to be a Yozi, and then the more indented on the right it is supposed to be what exactly ? Second Circle Demons ? And First Circle Demons ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T07:50:07-07:00","id":1420474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420099-chart-of-yozi-soul-hierarchies?p=1420439#post1420439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry I don't really understand how it works. The less indented name on the left is supposed to be a Yozi, and then the more indented on the right it is supposed to be what exactly ? Second Circle Demons ? And First Circle Demons ?</div> </div> </div> </div>From left to right: Yozi, Third Circle, Second Circle, First Circle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T09:04:25-07:00","id":1420485,"title":"","content":"I am pleased this exists. That's all I have to contribute.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8877-mrfamiliar","name":"MrFamiliar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}